{"id":"000VPI","title":"Geeky Ghost And The Fog","author":"Jorava","solvedCount":40,"difficulty":1,"rating":"89 %","firstSeen":"2026-10-26T14:21:40+00:00","posted":"Heute, 09:25 Uhr","rules":"A little trick or treat for the spooky week of halloween!\n\nDynamic fog, modular lines, renban, killer cages, MinMax.\n\nSolve in Sudokupad\n\n-----\n\nRules:\n\nNormal sudoku rules apply. Place the digits 1-9 in every row, column, and 3x3 box.\n\nKiller Cages:\nDigits in a cage cannot repeat and sum to the number in the top left corner of the cage.\n\nRenban:\nDigits on a thin purple line contain a set of non-repeating consecutive digits in any order.\n\nMinimum:\nThe digit in the cell with small arrows is smaller than any of its orthogonal neighbors.\n\nModular-3 Lines:\nEvery sequence of three cells on a thick teal line must contain one digit from each of these sets: 147, 258, 369.\n\nDynamic fog:\nThe grid is mostly covered in fog. Placing a correct digit will reveal its orthogonal neighboring cells, and possibly some other cells. Guessing is never required.\n\nNOTE 1: Aside from one broken bit patched with a Renban, every Modular Line is a continuous loop.\n\nNOTE 2: Brown lines are there for aesthetic reasons only.","solutionCode":"Column 4","tags":["Sudoku","Renban (Variante)","Killer (Variante)","MinMax (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/2rok8i94sj","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/2rok8i94sj","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":5,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-10-26T14:21:40+00:00"}